# API Naming

## Files

- Use `{domain}.{role}.ts` — lowercase domain, dot-separated role suffix.
- Multi-word names use **kebab-case**: `current-session.decorator.ts`, `typeorm.config.ts`.
- Migrations: `YYYYMMDD-description.ts` (e.g. `20260101-initial-schema.ts`).

```
level.controller.ts
level.service.ts
level.entity.ts
level.dto.ts
level.module.ts
current-session.decorator.ts
```

## Classes

- **PascalCase**, aligned with the domain: `LevelController`, `CreateLevelDto`, `LevelModule`.

This naming distinguishes API files from frontend PascalCase files.
